{"title": "Brave", "pageid": 6387, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Brave", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Brave_(Liara_Portyr)\" title=\"Brave (Liara Portyr)\">Brave (Liara Portyr)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Brave_(Note)\" title=\"Brave (Note)\">Brave (Note)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Brave.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Brave.webp/300px-Brave.webp, /w/images/e/e1/Brave.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Brave.webp/300px-Brave.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Brave.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Brave</b> is a passive feature available to all <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halflings</a>. It grants them <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> against being Frightened.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/%27Suspicious%27_Foont\" title=\"'Suspicious' Foont\">'Suspicious' Foont</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/%27Zinfandel%27_Gorse\" title=\"'Zinfandel' Gorse\">'Zinfandel' Gorse</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anderson\" title=\"Anderson\">Anderson</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arron\" title=\"Arron\">Arron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Babyjowls\" title=\"Babyjowls\">Babyjowls</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bad_Twin_Bubbins\" title=\"Bad Twin Bubbins\">Bad Twin Bubbins</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baz_Hopbank\" title=\"Baz Hopbank\">Baz Hopbank</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beulla_Sandfoot\" title=\"Beulla Sandfoot\">Beulla Sandfoot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blades_Bakstir\" title=\"Blades Bakstir\">Blades Bakstir</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bliggerillo\" title=\"Bliggerillo\">Bliggerillo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bloris_Meadhoney\" title=\"Bloris Meadhoney\">Bloris Meadhoney</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bramble\" title=\"Bramble\">Bramble</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brigand_Harrold\" title=\"Brigand Harrold\">Brigand Harrold</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brinn\" title=\"Brinn\">Brinn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brinna_Brightsong\" title=\"Brinna Brightsong\">Brinna Brightsong</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Burrock\" title=\"Burrock\">Burrock</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bustlebury\" title=\"Bustlebury\">Bustlebury</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chapeau\" title=\"Chapeau\">Chapeau</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cinna_Brewcellar\" title=\"Cinna Brewcellar\">Cinna Brewcellar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Highberry\" title=\"Cora Highberry\">Cora Highberry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Corliss_Undertump\" title=\"Corliss Undertump\">Corliss Undertump</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dashkent_Moliver\" title=\"Dashkent Moliver\">Dashkent Moliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Halfling_(Ancient_Lair)\" title=\"Dead Halfling (Ancient Lair)\">Dead Halfling (Ancient Lair)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t-Call-Me-Runt\" title=\"Don't-Call-Me-Runt\">Don't-Call-Me-Runt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Doora_Thumbfoot\" title=\"Doora Thumbfoot\">Doora Thumbfoot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drana_Hoyte\" title=\"Drana Hoyte\">Drana Hoyte</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drussuvissill\" title=\"Drussuvissill\">Drussuvissill</a>,  <a href=\"/wi